        meta:
          id: req_87853c0415ad45ca912c6eac6e23e688
          created: 1751674151145
          modified: 1778595783236
          isPrivate: false
          description: |
            # 🆕 Create an event

            **Method:** `POST`  
            **Endpoint:** `/api/event`  
            c

            ---

            ### 🧾 Explaination of everything
            **Tickets:** `How should tickets should be looking like`

            | Field            | Type     | Required | Description                                                  |
            |----------------- |--------- |--------- |------------------------------------------------------------ |
            | `ticket_name`       | string   | ✅       | The name of the ticket |
            | `ticket_price`         | number   | ✅       | The price of the ticket |
            | `ticket_for` | mumber (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The number of that each ticket represents (group of 5)|
            | `ticket_quantity` | mumber   | ✅       |The number of tickets the organizer want   |
            | `scope` | string enum (private ?? public ?? institution) (defaults to public)    | ✅  |How should the the infromation being displayed  |
            | `institutions` | array (optional if scope is institution)   | ✅       |The list of institution's id of which the tickets should be viewed by  |


            ```json
            "tickets": [
            	{
            	 "ticket_name": "VIP Ticket",  
            	 "ticket_price": 15, 
            	 "ticket_for":5,  
            	 "ticket_quantity": 200, 
            	 "scope": "public" ,  
            	 "institutions" : [4]
            	}
            ]
            ```

            **Overview:** `How should the overview will look like`

            | Field            | Type     | Required | Description                                                  |
            |----------------- |--------- |--------- |------------------------------------------------------------ |
            | `event_name`       | string   | ✅       | The name of the event |
            | `event_description`         | string   | ✅       | The description of the event |
            | `event_location` | string (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The location of the event|
            | `start_date` | date (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The start of the event|
            | `end_date` | date (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The end of the event|
            | `event_card_image` | image (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The card image|
            | `event_banner_image` | image (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The banner image|
            | `event_poster_image` | image (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The poster image|
            | `tickets` | JSON   | ✅       |The JSON of the tickets  |
            | `scope` | string enum (private ?? public ?? institution) (defaults to public)    | ✅  |How should the the infromation being displayed  |
            | `institutions` | array (optional if scope is institution)   | ✅       |The list of institution's id of which the events should be viewed by  |


            ### 💡 Example Request
            ```json
            {
            "event_name": "Test1",
            "event_description": "Annual technology conference focusing on AI and web development.",
            "event_location": "Nairobi International Convention Centre",
            "start_date": "2026-05-10T00:00:00.000Z",
            "end_date": "2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "event_genre": ["Physical","Adult Time"],
            "scope": "private",
            "institutions" : [1],
            "event_card_image": "https://sherehe-bucket.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/events/1776001374598-event_card_image.png",
            "event_poster_image": "https://sherehe-bucket.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/events/1776001374612-event_poster_image.png",
            "event_banner_image": "https://sherehe-bucket.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/events/1776001374611-event_banner_image.png",,
            "tickets": [
            	{"ticket_name": "VIP Ticket",  "ticket_price": 15, "ticket_for":5,  "ticket_quantity": 200, "scope": "public" ,  "institutions" : [1]}
            ]
            }
            ```

            ---

            ### ✅ Example Response (200 Created)
            ```json
            {
            	"message": "Event created successfully",
            	"data": {
            		"event": {
            			"created_at": "2026-04-12T13:42:56.138Z",
            			"updated_at": "2026-04-12T13:42:56.138Z",
            			"id": "99594839-21a1-40a7-b42d-c65bd4630def",
